  "summary": "The experiment tested multimodal integration using scvi_n200 (RNA) and imagenet_vit_l (image) encoders with transformer aggregation and concat fusion, achieving validation accuracy of 0.721 (F1: 0.681), exceeding the best RNA-only multiprofile baseline (0.650). This suggests multimodal fusion may improve performance, but the specific contributions of the image encoder or concat fusion strategy remain uncertain without direct comparisons to alternative modalities or fusion methods."
